{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.poster.avif?t=1767173659\" width=1170 height=367 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.webm?t=1767173659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.avif?t=1767173659\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras_big/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.webp?t=1767173659 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congratulations \u2014 you\u2019ve been accepted for a probationary period!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blueman is looking for motivated interns willing to do anything: set up workstations, feed the demon, make others work, and join corporate games without asking too many questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/4246de28eac6df53b4f315b1dbdbba9a.poster.avif?t=1767173659\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/4246de28eac6df53b4f315b1dbdbba9a.webm?t=1767173659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During probation you\u2019ll climb floor by floor: on each floor a new \u201cimportant task\u201d awaits \u2014 and for some reason it\u2019s entrusted to you. Clear every trial and, who knows, one day you might be the one giving the orders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A do-it-all intern.</strong> You play the person everything gets dumped on, from \u201clittle errands\u201d to tasks that somehow decide an entire department\u2019s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No monotonous grind.</strong> Each level plays like a standalone mini-game with its own rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Probation with no room for mistakes.</strong> Mistakes restart the current level, making attention to detail central to the gameplay \u2014 just like a real probation where perfection is expected and almost nothing is explained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hell suspiciously similar to work.</strong> Beneath the gloom and demons lurk very familiar office realities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short yet substantial.</strong> The compact format lets you experience the whole intern journey \u2014 from the first task to the top floor \u2014 in a single sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated completion time: </strong>~<strong>60 minutes</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps in Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135260/8e16616d563681209df21f3d4f354d4bc8a58b0a.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the game without mistakes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135260/c84eb75e9597f109f17de91e74fdf03f538265f2.jpg"},{"name":"Overseer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135260/f3bb081cf6a678c4ed81249eb43c971aa08f0e05.jpg"},{"name":"Escapee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135260/e4019bc1c29e7378cef5e6304bc972cf1cf6b761.jpg"},{"name":"666","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135260/2392b4b90aea2404f3e5a14c3a4c0b35b4f057cb.jpg"},{"name":"Food for the Geisha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135260/af01d801a64000f6cc4fbdfb6f9c689334ff8fac.jpg"},{"name":"New Year\u2019s Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3135260/adddb431cfdd3072537d9d74ba6ab693d4c23e0b.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3135260?t=1767173659","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/b861da316afded728e8163a0229423fd029911a6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767173659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/baa732f89939e68b19a90f1d472937b889a884ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767173659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/baa732f89939e68b19a90f1d472937b889a884ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767173659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blueman is an office worker simulator set in a demonic corporation. The game may contain non-realistic violence involving demonic entities without the depiction of blood."},"detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83d\udcccPlease note</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime: </strong>~<strong>60 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal was to provide a highly concentrated and varied gaming experience designed for a single evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf84\u2603\ufe0f\u2744\ufe0f Additionally, a New Year level has become available, as we wanted to congratulate our players on the holiday and thank them for their support!<br>Please note that the New Year level is available with English voice-over only.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.poster.avif?t=1767173659\" width=1170 height=367 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/8fddc02ca6a31a66db1ce3a8d5daacb6.webm?t=1767173659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.avif?t=1767173659\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras_big/f1dbfb71c839ae0f5fd40d3d728777b6.webp?t=1767173659 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congratulations \u2014 you\u2019ve been accepted for a probationary period!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blueman is looking for motivated interns willing to do anything: set up workstations, feed the demon, make others work, and join corporate games without asking too many questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/4246de28eac6df53b4f315b1dbdbba9a.poster.avif?t=1767173659\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/4246de28eac6df53b4f315b1dbdbba9a.webm?t=1767173659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During probation you\u2019ll climb floor by floor: on each floor a new \u201cimportant task\u201d awaits \u2014 and for some reason it\u2019s entrusted to you. Clear every trial and, who knows, one day you might be the one giving the orders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A do-it-all intern.</strong> You play the person everything gets dumped on, from \u201clittle errands\u201d to tasks that somehow decide an entire department\u2019s fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No monotonous grind.</strong> Each level plays like a standalone mini-game with its own rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Probation with no room for mistakes.</strong> Mistakes restart the current level, making attention to detail central to the gameplay \u2014 just like a real probation where perfection is expected and almost nothing is explained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hell suspiciously similar to work.</strong> Beneath the gloom and demons lurk very familiar office realities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short yet substantial.</strong> The compact format lets you experience the whole intern journey \u2014 from the first task to the top floor \u2014 in a single sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated completion time: </strong>~<strong>60 minutes</strong></p>","developers":["Ankoku"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/45a21653f6326a6e1d4a60b5ee22541910e8f34a/header.jpg?t=1767173659","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3135260/759808476/b064cefe8339753b3a55c14f17fb8d3523c388c0/1765394393/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765395447","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3135260/759808476/b064cefe8339753b3a55c14f17fb8d3523c388c0/1765394393/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765395447","hi